  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Introducing AWS Parallel Computing Service (AWS PCS), a new service makes it easy to setup and manage high performance computing (HPC) clusters, and build scientific and engineering models at virtually any scale on AWS.",
